'''Silver Week''' (秋色シルバーウィーク, ''Shūshoku Shirubā Wīku'', '''Autumn Silver Week''') is the Autumn event [[The Battle Cats]]. It was added in [[Version 6.4 Update|Version 6.4]]. The '''Machines in Revolt''' stages were added in [[Version 12.6 Update|Version 12.6]].

==Event Information==
The season of feasting has arrived! It's the Silver Week Event!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''On from October 10th (11:00am) until October 26th (10:59am)!'''}}

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Limited-Time Silver Week Stages'''}}<br>
During this event, visit the Legend Stages from the Battle Cats title menu and select from the following maps under the Special Stages section to take on this challenge.

※If this event does not appear, please update to the latest version of the Battle Cats.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''・Machines in Revolt'''}}<br>
Metal enemies attack the remnants of a destroyed city! Clear this stage to {{Color|#FF00FF|'''earn up to 10 Cat Tickets'''}}!<br>
Save the future from the onslaught of the coming machines!

※ After clearing a stage, there will be a short cooldown period before you are able to challenge the next stage.<br>
※ Spending a Catamin A will allow you to skip the stage cooldown period and challenge the next stage immediately.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''・Silver Week'''}}<br>
Limited time enemies appear only during this event!<br>
Clear this stage to earn Lucky Tickets that can be used at the Lucky Capsules! The more you get, the more chances to earn limited characters and rare items!<br>
Clearing later stages will increase the chance to earn Lucky tickets!

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Lucky Capsules now available!'''}}<br>
Limited time Lucky Capsules contain limited items, EXP, and rare items during the Silver Week Event!<br>
Select the {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Lucky Capsules'''}} from the Cat Capsules section of the Cat Base!<br>
Lucky Tickets can be earned from Silver Week stages and used to try the Lucky Capsules. {{Color|#FF00FF|'''One can also be earned from each pull of the Rare Capsules, with 11 being earned from 11-draw Capsules'''}}!

※Lucky Capsules will be available to use for as long as there are Lucky Tickets available to use, whether the Silver Week Event is on or not.<br>
※Lucky Tickets will still be available to use after the event ends.<br>
※If Lucky Capsules are not available in the Cat Capsules, then please update to the latest version of the Battle Cats.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Special Missions in the Catnip Challenges!'''}}<br>
Collect limited-time mission rewards by completing Silver Week stages!<br>
Once you've met the requirements, head to the Catnip Challenges and accept your prizes!<br>
※Limited-time Special Missions will only appear in the Catnip Challenges until the end of the event. You must accept all rewards before the mission disappears at the end of the Catnip Challenges event!

